    mail_subject: `Agent run not logged: ${e.client_id} (${e.outcome})`,
    mail_text: `A run for client ${e.client_id} could not be written to agent_run_log, so the caller got HTTP 503 and no answer.\n\nrun_id: ${e.run_id}\noutcome: ${e.outcome}\nprompt_sha256: ${e.prompt_sha256}\nanswer_sha256: ${e.answer_sha256 || '-'}\nreason: ${reason}\n\nIf the table failed after the entry was written, that entry may still be in the table. The daily check reports it if it broke the chain.`,
  },
}];

